🎈The Chief Trader's Last Bounce~
🔈: Do you think the chief receiver really has any strength? A little, but he is not as impressive as he jumps around every day, and your holding experience is very poor, making you feel like a grandson. How do others evaluate this person? You can see his trading ability for yourself, but his character can almost be concluded: trash.
💣 Ever since the frog incident, your dearest Brother Xi bravely became a sycophant, already standing with the frog and the doctor, starting to distinguish between the so-called rebate bloggers jumping around. Just one more and they can form a four-person gang. After you read this, who do you think has a good rebate?
🎉 At the end, I give a benefit to the fans. The so-called invincible intraday group robot of the chief cow-pusher has a very simple basic logic: you only need to add two indicators to your trading chart, one called: Bollinger Bands; the other called: MACD. When the MACD slow line crosses below the zero line, and the K line crosses below (or is below the middle band of the Bollinger Bands), go short;
When the MACD slow line crosses above the zero line, and the K line crosses above (or is above the middle band of the Bollinger Bands), go long;
🍾 It’s that simple. This is what he calls the computer indicator. Isn’t it ridiculous? Such a simple indicator can also be hidden and used to collect rebates. What face do you have left to mock what line-drawing masters? #ETH

