The recent performance of the crypto market can only be described as 'tragic.' With the market's violent fluctuations, the three major bullish whales of ETH have suffered significant blows:

Bitmine, although not leveraged, is currently deeply trapped due to extremely high costs;
Trend Research is just one step away from the liquidation red line of 1800 USD, facing liquidation at any moment;
What is most lamentable is that Garrett Jin's fund has already confirmed liquidation, with losses reaching 250 million USD and has stopped social updates.
These cold facts tell us: in the face of leveraged games, even the strongest capital can vanish in an instant. When the market's liquidity is drained due to massive liquidations, investors often find themselves in extreme passivity.
